yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# 2. 后端 Maven 编译产物与压缩包
**/target/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.nar
*.zip

# 3. 运行时动态生成的上传图片与日志
**/uploads/
**/logs/
*.log

